{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgP1exWQrzqsempyStB1K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I updated both script-analysis files for day 25. I didn't run tests, submit anything or touch any other file.\n\n1. **`reference/techniques/script-analysis.md`**: added the D25 \"Ashes to Assets\" day entry and shortened D24's. The new language was Elixir: 4 `polyglot-elixir-*.exs` files plus one `host-elixir-phoenix-elixir.exs`. The new host profile is `elixir_phoenix` and the host is a stub Phoenix controller that does nothing. The solver carried over from D23/D24 answered everything without changes and nothing was rejected. Single solve was CORRECT at T+14 s. Time Trial (1625 ids) and Mastery (9 sets, 14625 ids) were both correct first try. Also updated:\n   - **Variant axes:** the D23 timed id format held for a third day (Elixir adds 65 timed ids). There were no new encoding layers, and Mastery grows by one set per day.\n   - **Forecast cue:** it is now confirmed twice. The day's new language is the one that leaves the list of `next_language` values in the timed plans, and 15 remain.\n   - Added a recognition-cue row for `.exs`, and noted that the prompt's \"setting that didn't survive\" story was never asked about (12th day running).\n\n2. **`reference/coverage/script-analysis.md`**: marked Elixir `seen day25` (Erlang is still a gap) and updated the header and cue lines. The cues section is 59 lines. For the readiness gaps:\n   - Dropped the 3 built on D24 night and left 13 unbuilt `prebuild` gaps, in valid JSON with the same keys.\n   - Added `find-codecs-speed-gate` at priority 1. Three of last night's builds failed only because `find_codecs` exceeds the test's 2-second limit, so this goes first.\n   - Also new: `rust-cargo-buildrs-route`, `terraform-hcl-function-fold`, `stage-config-survival-diff` (the D25 story) and `eex-heex-template-carrier`.\n   - Re-ranked for D26 as Erlang, zsh/fish, then Rust, and added retry notes to every gap that failed.\n\n3. The techniques file is now 247 lines, longer than the ~200 target, because I kept the D23 entry and Variant axes detail in full."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":995,"cache_read_input_tokens":112079,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":995},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d888801-a517-4a07-bd3a-8bb4d598541c","uuid":"df822125-77f4-44df-83fc-bb79fa70b84c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:11:43.757Z","request_id":"req_011CgP1exFntmVmQVHjz9TTS"}
